OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after collision involving
OL,4,Afive vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a collision
OL,7,Finvolving five vehicles.
OL,9,FPolice were called to the incident on
OL,10,Fthe B1332 Norwich Road, at the junction
OL,11,Fwith Oakcroft Drive, in Poringland,
OL,12,Fnear Norwich, on 19 October at 10:55
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FThree people were taken to hospital and
OL,16,Fa man in his 60s, who had been driving
OL,17,Fa black Land Rover Freelander, died in
OL,18,Fhospital "several days later", Norfolk
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
